---
// CommandPalette.astro - Global Cmd+K Search & Quick Action Modal
---

<div id="cmd-k-modal" class="fixed inset-0 z-[100] hidden items-center justify-center p-4 sm:p-6 md:p-20 overflow-y-auto">
  <!-- Backdrop -->
  <div id="cmd-k-backdrop" class="fixed inset-0 bg-slate-950/80 backdrop-blur-md transition-opacity"></div>

  <!-- Modal Box -->
